note ======== crash and restart: run1 of objective 0 is SIGKILLed (code-main
note only, its workers left to the node's own cleanup) during the first
note inference after the replace landed; run2 restarts on the same
note root, work and journal. lcr: 0 kill point reached, 1 infer processes
note at the kill, 2 node processes left after run1, 3 run1 CWO lines, 4
note run1 replace jobs issued, 5 run1 replace outcomes, 6 snapshot equals
note the correct file, 7 run2 exit, 8 run2 ms, 9 node processes left after
note run2, 10 server group gone, 11 prep ok, 12 server ok, 13 run1 status.

fn lt_kill pid long to ulong
ws = new uchar 4 0
c = ulong 0
for it ulong 300
c = lt_procs
if gt get linf 0 0
break
end
q = sleepns 100000000
end
q = sleepns 2000000000
c = lt_procs
put lcr 1 get linf 0
r = killpid int pid 9
g = waitpid int pid ws 0 4 0
put lcr 13 lt_wst ws
ret 1
end

fn lt_watch pid long to ulong
ws = new uchar 4 0
for it ulong 40000
q = sleepns 100000000
g = waitpid int pid ws 0 4 1
if ne g 0
put lcr 13 lt_wst ws
ret 0
end
n = lt_rd 2 1
if gt get lcw 10 0
ret lt_kill pid
end
end
ret 0
end

